%% NexusERP — Ciclo de nómina con segregación de funciones

stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Open
  Open --> Calculating: payroll_analyst inicia cálculo
  Calculating --> InReview: cálculo idempotente OK
  Calculating --> Open: error / recalcular
  InReview --> Approved: payroll_approver distinto del preparador
  InReview --> Calculating: correcciones
  Approved --> Paying: disparar pagos
  Paying --> Paid: transferencias confirmadas
  Paid --> Closed: cierre inmutable
  Closed --> [*]

  note right of Approved
    SoD + ABAC: monto máximo,
    org_id, MFA step-up
  end note

  note right of Closed
    Correcciones solo vía
    payroll_adjustment en
    periodo siguiente
  end note
